    {
      "name": "Live agent activity",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Live activity stays at the end of the conversation, below plan, render and critique cards, so following a long design run keeps the latest execution visible. It shows the current reported action, total elapsed time and age of the last event, plus two recent completed tools and every running tool. File paths or commands are visible before expanding; each tool exposes output and arguments on demand. Running durations tick without requiring new events. View all activity opens and focuses the persistent strip’s full history. Reconnecting explicitly marks unavailable updates; silence is not presented as proof of continued progress.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-progress\" aria-label=\"Live agent activity\"><div class=\"ds-progress-heading\"><strong>Reading DESIGN.md</strong><span>12s</span></div><p>Last activity 2s ago</p><details><summary>Reading DESIGN.md <span>Running · 2s</span></summary><code>DESIGN.md</code></details><button>View all activity</button></section>",
